摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH Web ?????????:??? Web Speech API ????,????/??????????????????Microphone voice input plugin for the DeepSeek Harness Web UI (browser Web Speech API).","id":"gh:1334055650","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-mic-input","slug":"QT-Chen/dsh-mic-input","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","voice-input"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH Web ?????????:??? Web Speech API ????,????/??????????????????Microphone voice input plugin for t"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"he DeepSeek Harness Web UI (browser Web Speech API)."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-mic-input"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Microphone voice input for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web UI — in the browser, no server, no keys."},{"id":"p3s2","text":"Microphone voice input for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web UI — in the browser, no server, no keys.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> 中文说明见 README.zh.md"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"A pure client plugin that adds a **microphone button** to the composer tool row of the DSH Web GUI. "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"Click to start dictating; recognized speech is transcribed live into the input box. Everything runs "},{"id":"p5s3","text":"in your browser through the built-in **Web Speech API**:"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Microsoft Edge** → Microsoft Azure speech service\n- **Google Chrome** → Google/Chrome speech ser"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"Microsoft Edge** → Microsoft Azure speech service\n- **Google Chrome** → Google/Chrome speech service"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Zero server components, zero API keys, zero model downloads. Audio never leaves the browser (except "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"to the browser's own speech service)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Mic button** in the composer tool row (right side, next to send) — click to start/stop; red puls"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ing ring while listening\n- **Live transcription** — interim results fill the input while you speak\n-"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" **No duplicated text** — the draft is always rebuilt from the text that was in the input when recor"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"ding started, and interim echo prefixes are deduplicated (fixes the classic \"重复文字\" bug of Web Speech"},{"id":"p9s5","text":" plugins)\n- **Auto-continue on silence** — if the browser stops listening after a pause, the plugin "},{"id":"p9s6","text":"silently reconnects and keeps the session (up to 6 silent ends), so long sentences are not cut off\n-"},{"id":"p9s7","text":" **Smart punctuation** (default) — auto-completes sentence-ending punctuation: `？` after 吗/呢 questio"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"ns, `！` after 吧/啊/呀/哦/嘛/啦/哇/哈, `。` otherwise (English: `.`); modes: 自动补全 / 保留原样 / 去除\n- **Language se"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"lection** — 跟随系统 (auto, follows browser language) / 中文 (zh-CN) / English (en-US); wrong language mat"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"ching is the #1 cause of garbled recognition\n- **Auto-send** — optional: submit the message automati"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"cally when dictation ends\n- **Settings row** under 设置 → 通用 → 语音输入\n- **Clear errors** — permission-de"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"nied / network errors show bilingual hints on the button tooltip"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"or from npm (prebuilt, no build approval needed):"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` (or refresh the page), then click the **mic button** to the right of the input box"},{"id":"p14s2","text":". The first time you use it, the browser asks for microphone permission — allow it (127.0.0.1 / loca"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"lhost is a secure context, so it works)."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> Note: if you installed from the GitHub source, pnpm ≥ 10 may ask you to allow the build once (`all"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"owBuilds`). The npm install has no such step."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Usage tips"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- Recording starts a session; **click the button again to stop and keep the transcript** in the inpu"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"t (auto-send only if enabled)\n- If recognition produces gibberish, check the language setting — it m"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ust match what you speak (system language ≠ spoken language is the usual cause)\n- Recognition qualit"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"y is bounded by the browser's built-in engine; Edge (Azure) and Chrome (Google) may differ noticeabl"},{"id":"p17s5","text":" is bounded by the browser's built-in engine; Edge (Azure) and Chrome (Google) may differ noticeably"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Privacy"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"No server, no storage: audio is processed by the browser's speech service (Microsoft/Google), and on"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ly the resulting text ever enters DSH. Nothing is written to disk by this plugin."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
